! UPGRADE_PLAN WP-U1.7 (NCIM solver) — micro PQ-only snapshot.
! A two-line radial feeder (sourcebus -> mid -> loadbus) with all model-1
! constant-power loads, re-solved with Set algorithm=NCIM (the Newton
! Current-Injection Method). NCIM holds the swing bus at the ideal EMF (no
! Thevenin droop) and converges in 3 iterations on capi015 (dss_capi 0.15.x).
! Feature-sensitive: only the NCIM dispatch produces the ideal-EMF swing bus +
! the NCIM_CalcInjCurrAtBus swing-source reported currents.
Clear
New circuit.ncimtest basekv=12.47 phases=3 bus1=sourcebus
New Line.l1 bus1=sourcebus bus2=mid phases=3 r1=0.12 x1=0.35 length=2
New Line.l2 bus1=mid bus2=loadbus phases=3 r1=0.12 x1=0.35 length=1
New Load.ld1 bus1=loadbus phases=3 kv=12.47 kw=1200 kvar=500 model=1
New Load.ld2 bus1=mid phases=3 kv=12.47 kw=600 kvar=200 model=1
Set voltagebases=[12.47]
Calcvoltagebases
Set algorithm=NCIM
Solve
